  "description": "Experience Goose Goose Duck - available for free download and simple installation. Completely secure with no malware or viruses. Always have the latest version at your fingertips.",
  "editor_review": "🦆 Dive into Goose Goose Duck, a thrilling social deduction game set in the vibrant Birdverse! Team up with other geese to complete tasks while outsmarting sneaky Mallards and troublesome Fowls. 🌍 Discover 9+ distinctive locations like the S.S. Mothergoose and Mallard Manor, and select from over 50 character roles, including the Pelican and Party Duck. 🎮 Engage in multiple game modes such as Classic, Draft, and Corruption Mode, all while utilizing built-in Voice Chat and customizing your appearance. 🎩 Journey through the Birdverse, unveil exclusive limited-time items, and connect with the bustling Gaggle community on platforms like Twitter, Discord, TikTok, Instagram, and Facebook. Gear up for fun with Goose Goose Duck!",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Collaborate with your fellow geese to complete tasks and identify the impostors.",
    "Select from a wide array of character roles and various map settings.",
    "Make use of the Voice Chat feature to plan and discuss strategies with your allies.",
    "Gather and wear a selection of cosmetics to tailor your goose's look.",
    "Join in seasonal events to earn unique tokens and exclusive limited-time items."
  ],
